      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Raposa. Fennekin se agita com facilidade e seu corpo pode superaquecer, por isso libera calor pelas orelhas para se acalmar. Galhos são seu lanche favorito, e mastigá-los lhe dá coragem para enfrentar inimigos fortes.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Fennekin pode evoluir para Braixen no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Scratch, Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Ember</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Howl</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Flame Charge</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Fire Spin</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Light Screen, Lucky Chant</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Psyshock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Flamethrower</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Will-O-Wisp</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Fire Blast, Magic Room, Sunny Day</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Attract, Burning Jealousy, Calm Mind, Charm, Confide, Covet, Double Team, Dream Eater, Echoed Voice, Embargo, Encore, Endure, Facade, Fire Blast, Fire Pledge, Fire Spin, Flame Charge, Flamethrower, Flare Blitz, Foul Play, Frustration, Grass Knot, Heat Wave, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Imprison, Iron Tail, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Overheat, Protect, Psybeam, Psych Up, Psychic, Psychic Terrain, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Stored Power, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Will-O-Wisp, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Copycat, Heat Wave, Hypnosis, Magic Coat, Magic Room, Psychic Terrain, Wish</p>",
